data_hbn
# Phase identity: cxr-mc crystal catalog entry [hbn].
# Bundled full-basis P1 CIF used by the declarative material catalog.
# Catalog provenance and assumptions:
# Hexagonal boron nitride, P6_3/mmc, graphite-like layers with eclipsed B/N
# registry: the second layer swaps B and N sites so B lies above N across the
# van-der-Waals gap. Conventional hexagonal cell, four atoms (2 BN formula
# units). Lattice constants are standard bulk h-BN values a=2.504 A, c=6.661 A;
# the loader's limiting checks are stoichiometry, positive cell volume, and
# finite structure factors. Validation: hbn-structure
_symmetry_space_group_name_H-M 'P 1'
_symmetry_Int_Tables_number 1
_cell_length_a 2.504
_cell_length_b 2.504
_cell_length_c 6.661
_cell_angle_alpha 90.0
_cell_angle_beta 90.0
_cell_angle_gamma 120.0
